{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "range",
  "description": "Range-read profile (docs/plans/range-performance-plan.md, phase 0): the core fixture and series settings; the four raw RANGE windows with RESP3 twins (both engines emit identical bytes under RESP3, so the RESP2 \u2212 RESP3 spread is the wire-format share of a gap), `head100` as the dual of `recent100` (same reply, no discarded decoding), and GET / ADD as controls. Plan defaults: 5 paired trials, 5 s warm-up, 30 s read trials.",
